                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A northerly wind (that is, a northern wind, which blows from the north or northerly)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "northerly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3db900c5-7f1a-30d2-ab7a-c82aec495438",
                                        "entry_id": "69d121a3-950f-3b65-a970-fa3e3e908653",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Facing the north; directed towards the north."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f3e2463-a677-4f67-b591-d9698f13b4c0",
                                                "sense_id": "3db900c5-7f1a-30d2-ab7a-c82aec495438",
                                                "text": "a northerly voyage"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "693d186b-d767-4945-b89c-1acdfcc8540c",
                                                "sense_id": "3db900c5-7f1a-30d2-ab7a-c82aec495438",
                                                "text": "Those on the northerly route reached Ning-shan on February 16th, were joined there by a surviving group of Shih Ta-k’ai’s expeditionary soldiers under Cheng Chung-ho, and on March 26th converged at Nei-hsiang as planned with Ma Jung-ho’s army from the southerly route. Ch’en Ta-hsi’s Nien army, which had returned to Honan in the spring of 1863, also came to Nei-hsiang soon thereafter, at which point the entire force proceeded to Tsao-yang in Hupeh."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b027203-e7b4-3d1a-91bc-0da5ca488bd3",
                                        "entry_id": "69d121a3-950f-3b65-a970-fa3e3e908653",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Located in a northern region."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "183a4a93-8f39-4c13-8cdd-2a273e0fcf11",
                                                "sense_id": "7b027203-e7b4-3d1a-91bc-0da5ca488bd3",
                                                "text": "But I'm here to follow the less well-trodden route up to the most northerly point of the British mainland, which has its own scenic claim to make."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4aa9dec4-0dbe-33ed-b214-30e570699ccb",
                                        "entry_id": "69d121a3-950f-3b65-a970-fa3e3e908653",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Coming from the north."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dffab95d-ee4e-4830-995a-ffe2a425311c",
                                                "sense_id": "4aa9dec4-0dbe-33ed-b214-30e570699ccb",
                                                "text": "a northerly wind"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd58d9dd-3d3f-4a4d-96f9-5b2e81518705",
                                                "sense_id": "4aa9dec4-0dbe-33ed-b214-30e570699ccb",
                                                "text": "Now they were faced with the problem of a northerly blow, which could soon send a heavy swell clean into the bay."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b167dbad-7cc3-47fd-91ce-fb9fb93d02ce",
                                                "sense_id": "4aa9dec4-0dbe-33ed-b214-30e570699ccb",
                                                "text": "Over November 26-27, Storm Arwen brought northerly winds of up to 100 mph and snow in some parts of the UK."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "northerly",
